Heads up about <%= @organization.name %>

Hi <%= @co_member.name.presence || @co_member.email %>,

The owner of <%= @organization.name %> has requested that their MySigner
account be deleted. Because they own this organization, it and everything
inside it (builds, store credentials, signing keys, screenshots, release
notes, audit log) will be deleted along with their account on
<%= @deletes_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>.

You have 90 days from today to export anything you need. After
<%= @deletes_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %> the data is unrecoverable.

Things you can do right now:

  * Sign in and pull builds, screenshots, and listings via `mysigner sync`.
  * Reach out to the owner if you think this was a mistake -- they can
    restore the account at any time in the next 90 days using the link
    in their own email.
  * Reply to this email if you'd like our help exporting data or
    transferring ownership of this organization to a different account.

This message is sent once at the start of the grace window so you have
the full 90 days. We won't email you again unless you write back.
